OL,3,GNEWSABacklash to fake Post Office in
OL,4,AChristmas TV ad
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a backlash to a Post
OL,7,FOffice television advert which features
OL,8,Fa fake branch in a town centre that
OL,9,Fdoes not have one.
OL,11,FThe Christmas advert promotes the
OL,12,Fcompany as the "home of parcel
OL,13,Fdrop-off" - a claim residents have
OL,14,Fdescribed as "ironic" because the
OL,15,Fadvert features Frome, in Somerset,
OL,16,Fwhich does not have a branch.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
