OL,3,GNEWSABacklash to fake Post Office in
OL,4,AChristmas TV ad
OL,5,
OL,6,FDave Smith Price posted on Facebook
OL,7,Fthat it was "ridiculous when everyone
OL,8,Fcomplains we don't have a post office
OL,9,Fin the town centre, yet they've used
OL,10,Fthe town centre as the location for an
OL,11,Fad".
OL,13,FA Post Office spokesperson apologised
OL,14,Fto the "people of Frome" for any
OL,15,Fconfusion and said that Catherine
OL,16,FStreet had been chosen because it was
OL,17,F"picturesque".
